        <span>WHAT TRAVELERS SAY</span>
        <h2>Customer Reviews</h2>
        <p>Real experiences from real travelers</p>
    </div>
    <div class="testimonials-grid">
        <div class="testimonial-card">
            <div class="stars">★★★★★</div>
            <p>"Our Kerala trip was absolutely magical. The houseboat experience on Alleppey backwaters was a dream come true. SkyTour handled everything perfectly!"</p>
            <div class="reviewer">
                <div class="reviewer-avatar">P</div>
                <div><strong>Priya Sharma</strong><span>Mumbai</span></div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="testimonial-card">
            <div class="stars">★★★★★</div>
            <p>"Booked the Bali honeymoon package and it exceeded all expectations. The private pool villa, the sunset dinner — absolutely worth every rupee!"</p>
            <div class="reviewer">
                <div class="reviewer-avatar">R</div>
                <div><strong>Rahul & Neha</strong><span>Delhi</span></div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="testimonial-card">
            <div class="stars">★★★★☆</div>
            <p>"Took my family to Manali through SkyTour. The kids loved the snow activities, the hotel was amazing, and the whole trip was well-organised. Highly recommended!"</p>
            <div class="reviewer">
                <div class="reviewer-avatar">A</div>
                <div><strong>Amit Patel</strong><span>Ahmedabad</span></div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- NEWSLETTER -->
<section class="newsletter-section" id="newsletter">
    <div class="newsletter-content">
        <div class="newsletter-text">
            <h2><i class="fas fa-paper-plane"></i> Stay Updated</h2>
            <p>Subscribe to our newsletter for exclusive deals, travel tips, and destination guides.</p>
        </div>
        <form class="newsletter-form" action="/newsletter" method="POST">
            <input type="email" name="email" placeholder="Enter your email address" required>
            <button type="submit">Subscribe <i class="fas fa-arrow-right"></i></button>
        </form>
    </div>
</section>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
